# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): the device tier, out of the v1 cut (note/term/stdlib/v1-release.md). It declared tasks that bound nothing, so a call built clean and
# threw `stub` at run time; out of the build until it has bodies.

task check-authorization-status

task request-access

task get-default-device

task clear-take-photo-settings

task is-auto-red-eye-reduction-enabled
  # A Boolean value that determines whether to use auto red-eye reduction on flash captures.

form camera
  task has-flash
  task set-flash, take mode
  task clear-settings
